ture (currently in progress per `docs/features/Planner/` and the new `TaskPlan.kt` domain model) — a checklist/plan panel pinned above chat that the LLM updates as it works through multi-step tasks.\n- Editor actions, skills (`SKILL.md` files like `explain-element`, `find-smells`, `write-kdoc`), and Python support alongside Kotlin.\n\n**Development style:** the `docs/features/*` and `docs/refactors/*` directories show heavy use of step-by-step planning docs (PLAN.md + STEP_N_*.md per feature) — this project is itself built using an incremental, documented, AI-assisted workflow, which is fitting since the tool's purpose is to enable exactly that kind of workflow for its users.\n\nIn short: **it's a meta tool** — an IDE plugin, built with AI assistance, whose entire purpose is to make AI coding assistance more structurally aware and reliable by grounding it in PSI rather than raw text.","stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"75a63246-cd0f-4742-a144-6e8c2a5883a5","total_cost_usd":0.17682070000000003,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":25028,"cache_read_input_tokens":14849,"output_tokens":1045,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":25028,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1045,"cache_read_input_tokens":14849,"cache_creation_input_tokens":25028,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":25028},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001":{"inputTokens":6442,"outputTokens":15,"cacheReadInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationInputTokens":0,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.006517,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":32000},"claude-sonnet-5":{"inputTokens":2,"outputTokens":1045,"cacheReadInputTokens":14849,"cacheCreationInputTokens":25028,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.17030370000000003,"contextWindow":1000000,"maxOu